Evidence: F001/F002 setup-runner behavior.

The print-only surface labels `firebase_login`, `gcloud_auth_login`, and
`smoke_test` as human-required and includes the manifest-provided reason text.

The guarded runner preserves that boundary: human-required setup steps are
reported as `skipped_human_required` and never passed to the command runner.
Regression coverage lives in `test_capabilities_setup_runner_f002.py` and
`test_capabilities_setup_evidence_f003.py`.
